{"meta":{"id":"interface","category":"it/syntax/typescript/object","title":"인터페이스 (Interface) · TS","subtitle":"(TYPESCRIPT)","summary":"객체 형태 정의, extends 확장, 인덱스 시그니처, interface vs type","tags":["typescript","f-interface","f-object"],"color":"emerald","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-emerald","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-emerald-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-emerald-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>TYPESCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">인터페이스 (Interface) · TS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 객체 형태 정의, extends 확장, 인덱스 시그니처, interface vs type</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">인터페이스 (interface)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">interface User {\r\n  id: number;\r\n  name: string;\r\n  email?: string;\r\n  greet(): string;          // 메서드\r\n}\r\n\r\nconst u: User = {\r\n  id: 1,\r\n  name: &quot;kim&quot;,\r\n  greet() { return `hi ${this.name}`; },\r\n};</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">객체의 형태(속성 · 메서드)를 정의한다. 클래스가 implements 로 구현해야 할 대상이 되기도 한다</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">확장 (extends) · 선언 병합</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">interface Admin extends User {\r\n  role: &quot;admin&quot;;\r\n}\r\n\r\n// 같은 이름으로 다시 선언하면 합쳐진다 (type 은 불가)\r\ninterface Window { appVersion: string }</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">인덱스 시그니처 (Index Signature)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">interface Dictionary {\r\n  [key: string]: string;     // 키 이름은 모르지만 값 타입은 string\r\n}\r\n\r\nconst labels: Dictionary = { ok: &quot;확인&quot;, cancel: &quot;취소&quot; };\r\nlabels[&quot;save&quot;] = &quot;저장&quot;;\r\n\r\n// Record 로도 표현 가능\r\nconst counts: Record&lt;string, number&gt; = {};</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">키가 미리 정해지지 않은 객체(사전, 맵)를 표현할 때 사용</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">interface vs type</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\"></th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">interface</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">type</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">객체 형태</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">O</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">O</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">유니온 / 원시 타입 별칭</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">X</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">O</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">확장</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">extends</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">&amp; (교차 타입)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">선언 병합</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">O</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">X</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> 클래스 › 상속 (implements)</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/typescript/object/interface","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"typescript","title":"TYPESCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/typescript"},{"id":"object","title":"객체 · 컬렉션","path":"it/syntax/typescript/object"}],"hasImage":false}